<description>&lt;p&gt;An ICE officer has been indicted for allegedly running over an undocumented Mexican immigrant, who was released on bond. A Chinese citizen was convicted of drug trafficking linked to the Jalisco New Generation Cartel. A small plane crashed shortly after takeoff in Mexico, killing the pilot and co-pilot. These incidents illustrate continued violence and law-enforcement actions tied to Mexican cartels. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9LbHJTQ2xBMmVHaldLaDE1eUFiNnNocDdSQkZRd0dOQkdmTDFNUHZmY0lxbnNuZ19RaWYtQ3o4MlVDejlvXzFvVThrQlNxcGRkTzBOVExLMFNfVENkdTVrRGZzR3phTEdjS3hEUWk0X1NjeFRuejNPOFU5RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPY0RfS3JmdEtteW15RW5ndlVhQnM5SDIyWVV3NWhiYTRrNjJVWmtia2lkZ0taNlVhcW1GNjNRcDdjLTc1Q3UxS2NPRjl5WDBabkpoTEdwaFZkYklxaDJ3b1hxQmdaVnBvMFJfdEtrX25xejlxTjBlblkyU3IxcVFWb0htT0c0bVJHbnl2eHVkS29VelFaUV9LYUJ5MEV3NTZGVnh3c0ZJSmJTNFdoakwzQWQ2TQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Telangana Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5Lc1hqdFRVR3dNNTM0eXY3d1h0ckRaNFktQUlJcVhKa1N5NEpFYmVJbWlGc3M3U09DcmsteVhxRjFSYWIyby03TGtrSDRjUHpzcFgtaWpZNmpjVUc2?oc=5&quot;&gt;People.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSkFVX3lxTE9HWG11ei0zcS1rTVNrS3E0eFN0YWw4ZEh4Qm1NTE8teEdJbTZJZmlnTDh2cHV3VkVmRk1mWGZwd3pIRUhwa1JZb3RB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;newscentermaine.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Lat